   - Fixed `reserve` to allow reservations up to the exact available quantity (`qty > self.available(sku)` instead of `>=`).
   - Fixed `release` with a guard check to raise a `ValueError` when releasing more than the currently reserved quantity.
3. **`src/text_utils.py`**:
   - Refactored `slugify` to lowercase characters and collapse consecutive hyphens correctly.
   - Fixed `truncate` to subtract the length of the suffix (e.g. `"…"`) from `max_len` to guarantee the final output string never exceeds the requested maximum length.

